{"id":"1660928861084af0","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-probabilistic-method.md","title":"有限概率空间的平均值见证","display":"lem-probabilistic-method — 有限概率空间的平均值见证","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-probabilistic-method","aliases":["28-lem-probabilistic-method"],"display":"lem-probabilistic-method — 有限概率空间的平均值见证","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Lemma A.5","source_printed_pages":"512","source_pdf_pages":"538","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-probabilistic-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-probabilistic-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-probabilistic-method — 有限概率空间的平均值见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma A.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"512"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"538"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)=1\">\\(\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\">\\(\\mu=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu}p(\\omega)&gt;0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu}p(\\omega)&gt;0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\omega\\in\\Omega\\quad p(\\omega)&gt;0\\land X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\omega\\in\\Omega\\quad p(\\omega)&gt;0\\land X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若所有正质量点都满足 X&lt;μ，则有限加权平均也严格小于 μ，矛盾。零概率点不构成见证；因此本项比只声称存在一个点更明确。原书用此平均法把随机赋值的期望值转为确定性存在性。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma A.5；印刷页 512；PDF 页 538。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)=1","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu}p(\\omega)>0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\omega\\in\\Omega\\quad p(\\omega)>0\\land X(\\omega)\\ge\\mu.","display":true}],"bytes":1280,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-420","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-lem-probabilistic-method]]、[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]、[[28-thm-chebyshev-inequality]]、[[28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}